{"4270010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tunnelers", "steam_appid": 4270010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnelers is an online co-op horror game where you mine for gold with up to 5 players. Venture into dark tunnels, recover lost equipment, set off explosives, and uncover secrets as you descend into increasingly dangerous caverns in pursuit of the eerie unknown at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/9a76266db5191313b629e81a99927d24.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/6e517df89ae8b899b15f57a5cbfd19a0.poster.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/6e517df89ae8b899b15f57a5cbfd19a0.webm?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/6e517df89ae8b899b15f57a5cbfd19a0.mp4?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and extract as much gold as possible to obtain maximum profits. Use your hard-earned cash to purchase better mining equipment, or find it yourself in the abandoned underground passageways. Don’t spend all of your earnings, as you’ll need to pay the elevator service fee to continue your descent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/1c4f516d702a110eb37f5f8e6d1760ab.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/a76465f9d8942a1bfc753d52f301a5c3.poster.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/a76465f9d8942a1bfc753d52f301a5c3.webm?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/a76465f9d8942a1bfc753d52f301a5c3.mp4?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caverns are dark and disorienting. Mark explored paths, or dig your own tunnels if necessary. Use proximity voice chat to keep in touch with your fellow miners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/10dfdba2f5a2837d13693099c02839dc.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/af94a68648cd9acfcac68d82c23d7617.poster.avif?t=1772298982\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/af94a68648cd9acfcac68d82c23d7617.webm?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/af94a68648cd9acfcac68d82c23d7617.mp4?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep away from various hazards, traps, and unsafe equipment. There are more dangerous things lurking in the dark. Avoid fatal <i>accidents</i> or be forced to restart your descent.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnelers is an online co-op horror game where you mine for gold with up to 5 players. Venture into dark tunnels, recover lost equipment, set off explosives, and uncover secrets as you descend into increasingly dangerous caverns in pursuit of the eerie unknown at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/9a76266db5191313b629e81a99927d24.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/6e517df89ae8b899b15f57a5cbfd19a0.poster.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/6e517df89ae8b899b15f57a5cbfd19a0.webm?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/6e517df89ae8b899b15f57a5cbfd19a0.mp4?t=1772298982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and extract as much gold as possible to obtain maximum profits. Use your hard-earned cash to purchase better mining equipment, or find it yourself in the abandoned underground passageways. Don’t spend all of your earnings, as you’ll need to pay the elevator service fee to continue your descent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/1c4f516d702a110eb37f5f8e6d1760ab.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270010/extras/a76465f9d8942a1bfc753d52f301a5c3.poster.avif?t=1772298982\" width=1170 height=658 ><sourc